Apple/MSP 入站端点。规则（docs/integration/imess:
Apple/MSP inbound endpoint. Rules (docs/integration/imessage.md section 3):
- the body may be gzipped, so it must be decompressed before parsing;
- identity comes from the headers (Source-Id / Destination-Id / Id) and must match the body, otherwise 400;
- missing Authorization means 401, an invalid JWT/MSP id means 403;
- Apple **retries only on 5xx** (4 attempts, backoff starting at 100ms), so business errors must return 4xx to keep Apple from redelivering

图片预览直链（LINE image 消息的 previewImageUrl）。\:
Image preview direct link (the previewImageUrl of a LINE image message).
This repository does not add an image resizing library (the no-new-dependency constraint), so the preview link returns exactly the same bytes;
if an image exceeds the LINE preview limit, LineService automatically omits previewImageUrl and sends only originalContentUrl

