Supported operations: delete / setStatus / setEventType / moveOffset

Examples:
- Delete: { "ids":[1,2,3], "op":"delete" }
- Change status: { "ids":[1,2], "op":"setStatus", "status":"completed" }
- Change type: { "ids":[1,2], "op":"setEventType", "eventType":"meeting" }
- Move by 1 day and 30 minutes: { "ids":[1,2], "op":"moveOffset", "daysOffset":1, "minutesOffset":30 }

