获取指定对象类型可用的自定义字段（按渠道过滤）。\r\n传入 sourceTyp:
Get the custom fields available for a given object type (filtered by channel).
Pass sourceType (for example "wechat") to return global fields plus the fields specific to that channel;
fields of disabled channels are filtered out according to the HideWhenChannelDisabled rule

返回的 `total/translated/untranslated/perce:
The returned `total/translated/untranslated/percentage` use the **back-end resx entry set** as the denominator;
the entry set on the translation management page also includes front-end UI keys (`frontend/src/locales/*`, several thousand entries),
so the page additionally adds `uiKeyCount + total` and uses `dbKeyCount` (the number of DB override rows) as the "customized" count.
